OL,3,GNEWSAUnfair dismissal claims from
OL,4,Adoctor thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who claimed he was unfairly
OL,7,Fdismissed following a review into
OL,8,FJersey Hospital's rheumatology
OL,9,Fdepartment has had his case thrown out
OL,10,Fby a tribunal.
OL,12,FDr Michael Richardson was suspended
OL,13,Ffrom his role at Health and Care Jersey
OL,14,F(HCJ) in January 2022 over concerns
OL,15,Faround patient safety. Following an
OL,16,Finvestigation into the service by the
OL,17,FRoyal College of Physicians (RCP), he
OL,18,Fwas dismissed in June 2025.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
