OL,3,GNEWSAUnfair dismissal claims from
OL,4,Adoctor thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichardson argued his suspension was
OL,7,Funjustified, that he had been the
OL,8,Fsubject of a "witch hunt", and that the
OL,9,Freport by the RCP was "fundamentally
OL,10,Fflawed".
OL,12,FThe tribunal ruled his dismissal was
OL,13,Ffair and him returning to work would
OL,14,Flead to a loss of public confidence in
OL,15,Fthe health service.
